                <note rend="inline" type="source">123J634/343: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-06-06T20:00:00-04:00">June 6, 1935—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>151. Your 115, May 22, 4 p.m. The President desires to appoint you as Ambassador
                    to China. Request <hi rendition="#italic">agrément</hi> of Chinese Government
                    and telegraph reply as early as possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
